From 54a8346e55526221f3d5882291f87e0fa66cab03 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shadaytree <82917003+shadaytree@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:02:06 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] fix(mcp): detect_holes on a stock source names the stock and
 the models to pick

A Drill, Bore or Thread operation reads the stock when no model is
picked as its source. Detect holes then found nothing and said "the
source model", which pointed at the wrong thing. The three refusals now
say "the stock" and add the fix: pick a model as the source
(source: "<model>"), or import a model when the document has none. A
model source keeps its old refusal.

Fixes #3544

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
